#19097
Inside the mountain~
You walk into a large enclosure with gracious bison carvings and imported
Swiss furniture. Cracked Egyptian pots with large flowering ferns sit on
rainbow coloured sheepskin rugs. On the east wall, there is a charcoal
sketched portrait of a party of raiding ragers standing over a field of
multilated bodies of mages and clerics.

Someone with bad taste obviously lives here.
~
